{"recipes":[{"_id":"dish-pumpkin","titleEn":"Pumpkin Spread","titleEs":"Crema de Calabaza","recipeType":"DISH","category":"To Plate","active":true,"sortOrder":1,"methodEn":"Season both sides of sourdough bread with EVOO, salt and pepper. Grill until crispy, about 1–2 minutes per side. Cut into 4 pieces and plate.\n\nIn a large shallow bowl, spoon/spread Pumpkin Spread as pictured. Drizzle with pomegranate molasses and Brown Butter, then top with Seed Mix. Finish with micro cilantro and dill. Finish with Sea Salt.","methodEs":"Sazone ambos lados del pan de masa madre con AOVE, sal y pimienta. Áselo hasta que esté crujiente, aproximadamente 1–2 minutos por lado. Córtelo en 4 piezas y emplate.\n\nEn un tazón grande y poco profundo, coloque/extienda la Crema de Calabaza. Rocíe con melaza de granada y mantequilla dorada, y cubra con la mezcla de semillas. Termine con micro cilantro y eneldo. Finalice con sal marina."},{"_id":"prep-pumpkin","titleEn":"Pumpkin Spread","titleEs":"Crema de Calabaza","recipeType":"SUBRECIPE","category":"Preparation","yieldQty":1000,"yieldUnitEn":"g (1 qt)","yieldUnitEs":"g (1 qt)","active":true,"sortOrder":2,"methodEn":"Rub pumpkin with EVOO and season accordingly. Place pumpkin on grill and char, rotating as needed; about 1 to 1.5 hours. Peel/remove seeds. Process pumpkin through ricer. Reserve.\n\nIn a large rondeau combine 6000g charred pumpkin pulp with all remaining ingredients except tahini paste. Cover with a cartouche over medium-low heat and braise until vegetables are soft/tender. Working in batches, blend the pumpkin soubise until smooth, working tahini paste into each batch. Once blended, mix batches and pass through a Tami.\n\nIn a separate bowl combine Set 2 and mix well. Transfer to delis for service.","methodEs":"Frote la calabaza con AOVE y sazone. Colóquela en la parrilla y carbonice, girándola según sea necesario; aproximadamente 1 a 1.5 horas. Pele, retire las semillas y pase la pulpa por un prensador. Reserve.\n\nEn una rondeau grande combine 6000 g de pulpa de calabaza carbonizada con todos los ingredientes restantes excepto la pasta de tahini. Cubra con un cartouche a fuego medio-bajo y brasee hasta que las verduras estén tiernas. Trabajando por tandas, licúe la soubise de calabaza hasta obtener una textura lisa, incorporando tahini en cada tanda. Mezcle las tandas y pase por un Tami.\n\nEn un recipiente separado combine el Set 2 y mezcle bien. Transfiera a recipientes para servicio."},{"_id":"seedmix","titleEn":"Heritage Seed Mix","titleEs":"Mezcla Heritage de Semillas","recipeType":"SUBRECIPE","category":"Preparation","yieldQty":1000,"yieldUnitEn":"g (1 qt)","yieldUnitEs":"g (1 qt)","active":true,"sortOrder":3,"methodEn":"In a mixing bowl, combine all the ingredients and mix. Store in a deli cup with silica packets.","methodEs":"En un tazón de mezcla, combine todos los ingredientes y mezcle. Guarde en un recipiente deli con paquetes de sílica."}],"sections":[{"_id":"dish","recipeId":"dish-pumpkin","titleEn":"To Plate","titleEs":"Para emplatar","sortOrder":1},{"_id":"set1","recipeId":"prep-pumpkin","titleEn":"Set 1","titleEs":"Set 1","sortOrder":1},{"_id":"set2","recipeId":"prep-pumpkin","titleEn":"Set 2","titleEs":"Set 2","sortOrder":2},{"_id":"seed","recipeId":"seedmix","titleEn":"Ingredients","titleEs":"Ingredientes","sortOrder":1}],"components":[{"_id":"c1","sectionId":"dish","componentType":"SUBRECIPE","quantity":150,"unitEn":"g","unitEs":"g","displayEn":"Pumpkin Spread","displayEs":"Crema de Calabaza","targetRecipeId":"prep-pumpkin","targetIngredientId":"","targetPreparationId":"","sortOrder":1,"noteEn":"","noteEs":""},{"_id":"c2","sectionId":"dish","componentType":"SUBRECIPE","quantity":12,"unitEn":"g","unitEs":"g","displayEn":"Heritage Seed Mix","displayEs":"Mezcla Heritage de Semillas","targetRecipeId":"seedmix","targetIngredientId":"","targetPreparationId":"","sortOrder":2,"noteEn":"","noteEs":""},{"_id":"c3","sectionId":"dish","componentType":"INGREDIENT","quantity":6,